{"id":"vod_sn_36720","vodId":"36720","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"24号","name_cn":"24号","date":"2019-01-01","year":"2019","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/fd467ffe674b2688643d688a8ab7ea91.jpg"},"summary":"柚木夏纱（河西健吾 配音）是一名非常出色的橄榄球运动员，带着众人的期待和对未来的希冀，他进入了堂紫社大学就读，准备在这里施展一番拳脚。哪知道，一场意外的发生，让柚木再也无法重新站上赛场，他有可能将要永远的告别橄榄球这项自己挚爱的运动项目了。　　柚木青梅竹马的玩伴真行寺清一郎（铃木崚汰 配音）、曾经背负着天才运动员的名号，如今却选择了隐退的上丘伊吹（柳田淳一 配音）、非常崇拜柚木，一直不离不弃的追随着他的脚步的真白优（村濑步 配音）和亦敌亦友，在橄榄球运动上充满了天赋的都留靖也（小松昌平 配音），好在有这些朋友们的支持和信赖，柚木充实了信心，向关西大学橄榄球循环赛发起了挑战。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:45:32","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/JsGmZnQ0qS1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/YMrRKXcPii1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/2Cx3cWwqGd1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/3KAYvsqygk1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/j1UENAYQKw1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/1gJNMi3yic1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/kF9QqZtPuT1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/uuyQPyPpsT1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/kxcK3aBZXh1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/j1Q9tCKM1u1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/9FFCwHGG7E1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/z3Wvyqaivk1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/J6t3ZzczLY1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:19.575Z"}